        "url": "agreements.html#name-and-files",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "AgreementInfo::create(string $name): AgreementInfo Starts a builder. The name appears in email subjects, on the signing page and in the sender's list, so make it specific (\"NDA - Acme Ltd\", not \"Contract\"). A blank name throws InvalidArgumentException immediately. On a developer account Adobe prefixes it with [DEMO USE…"
