        "url": "agreements.html#participants",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "->participantSet(ParticipantSetInfo $set): AgreementInfo Adds one step of the workflow. A set without an explicit order() is numbered one after the previous set, so sets added one after another sign one after another. ParticipantSetInfo is below. ->signers(string ...$emails): AgreementInfo Shortcut for the most common…"
