        "url": "agreements.html#raw-payloads",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "create() accepts three kinds of input. They all reach the same endpoint, but they differ in what the SDK does first: InputLocal validationDefault signature levelUse it when AgreementInfo builderYesAppliedAlmost always; add with() for extras. AgreementCreationInfo modelNoNot appliedYou want typed access to every field i…"
