        "page": "Creating agreements",
        "url": "agreements.html#validation",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "The builders check everything they can know locally and throw Conceptlz\\AdobeSign\\Exception\\InvalidArgumentException (which implements AdobeSignException) before any request. Some checks run as you call the method; the ones that need the whole agreement run in toArray(), which create() calls. MessageThrown byWhen Agree…"
