        "url": "signature-levels.html#formal-validation",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "signatureEvidence() reads Adobe's records, which is the right tool for workflow decisions (\"can we release the goods?\"). For an authoritative statement, for example in a dispute, validate the signatures inside the signed PDF itself against the trusted lists, using validation software such as the EU's DSS demonstration…"
