        "level": 2,
        "text": "Email OTP, SMS codes, knowledge-based questions, government ID scans and national eIDs control who can open the agreement. They make an SES much more convincing as evidence, and they are worth adding at any level, but they don't turn an SES into an AES. Only a certificate-based digital signature does that. Combine the…"
