        "url": "signature-levels.html#signature-levels-faq-default-change",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Nothing. The level is part of the request that creates the agreement; changing ClientOptions later affects only new agreements built with AgreementInfo. To change an agreement in flight, cancel it and send a new one (see Managing agreements)."
