        "page": "Identity verification · FAQ",
        "url": "identity-verification.html#identity-verification-faq-combine",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "No. Adobe accepts one authenticationMethod per participant, and a second verifyWith() call replaces the first. Pick the stronger single method, or add a digital signature (AES), which brings the signing provider's own authentication."
